---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import ServiceSelector from '../components/ServiceSelector.astro';
import TrustRail from '../components/TrustRail.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Professional Cleaning Services London | High Quality Clean"
  description="Professional cleaning services for London homes, workplaces and managed properties. Find the right HQC service for the condition, outcome and work required."
>
  <Header />

  <main class="bg-porcelain pt-20">
    <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-midnight text-white">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[.08]" style="background-image:radial-gradient(circle at 1px 1px,#fff 1px,transparent 0);background-size:34px 34px"></div>
      <div class="relative mx-auto grid min-h-[780px] max-w-[1440px] items-center gap-12 px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-[.92fr_1.08fr] lg:px-14">
        <div class="relative z-10 py-8">
          <p class="section-kicker">Cleaning Defined by the Outcome</p>
          <h1 class="mt-6 max-w-3xl font-serif text-[clamp(3.8rem,7vw,7.2rem)] font-medium leading-[.88] tracking-[-.045em]">
            The right cleaning service<br /><em class="font-medium text-copper">for the result you need.</em>
          </h1>
          <p class="mt-8 max-w-xl text-lg leading-8 text-white/75 md:text-xl">From recurring home cleaning to workplace programmes, property handovers and complex projects, High Quality Clean matches the service, labour and delivery approach to the condition of the space and the outcome required.</p>
          <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
            <a href="#find-my-service" class="button button-primary" data-track="find_my_service">Find my service <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
            <a href="/request-a-quote/" class="button button-ghost" data-track="request_quote">Request a tailored quote</a>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap gap-x-8 gap-y-3 border-t border-white/15 pt-7 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.14em] text-white/55">
            <span>London-based</span><span>Outcome-led</span><span>Founder-led</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="relative min-h-[570px] lg:min-h-[670px]">
          <figure class="absolute left-[4%] top-[3%] h-[62%] w-[67%] overflow-hidden rounded-[2.2rem]">
            <img src="/images/generated/hqc-home-hero.png" alt="Illustrative London living room prepared for a home-cleaning enquiry" class="h-full w-full object-cover" width="1024" height="1024" fetchpriority="high" />
          </figure>
          <figure class="absolute bottom-[2%] right-0 h-[53%] w-[55%] overflow-hidden rounded-[2.2rem] border-[10px] border-midnight">
            <img src="/images/generated/hqc-property-hero.png" alt="Illustrative London property prepared for a professional handover" class="h-full w-full object-cover" width="1284" height="850" fetchpriority="high" />
          </figure>
          <div class="absolute bottom-[11%] left-0 max-w-[17rem] rounded-2xl bg-copper p-6 text-midnight shadow-2xl">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-midnight/55">Start with the result</span>
            <p class="mt-4 font-serif text-2xl font-semibold leading-tight">Maintenance, restoration, handover or a recurring programme.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="absolute right-[2%] top-[9%] flex h-24 w-24 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-copper/50 bg-midnight/80 text-center text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.15em] text-copper backdrop-blur">Careful<br />delivery</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-shell">
      <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[.72fr_1.28fr] lg:gap-24">
        <div>
          <p class="section-kicker">Choose your route</p>
          <h2 class="section-title">One cleaning partner. Three different kinds of need.</h2>
          <p class="mt-7 text-lg leading-8 text-slate">The site is organised around the buyer and the result, so a home client is not forced through the same journey as a property manager or workplace team.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          {[
            {
              number: '01',
              eyebrow: 'Property & Facilities',
              title: 'Managed properties, portfolios and projects',
              copy: 'Repeat instructions, communal areas, voids, handovers and portfolio support.',
              href: '/property-facilities-cleaning-london/',
              image: '/images/generated/hqc-property-hero.png'
            },
            {
              number: '02',
              eyebrow: 'Workplaces & Commercial',
              title: 'Recurring programmes and operational resets',
              copy: 'Office cleaning and commercial deep cleaning planned around the working site.',
              href: '/commercial-cleaning-london/',
              image: '/images/generated/hqc-office-hero.png'
            },
            {
              number: '03',
              eyebrow: 'Homes & Private Clients',
              title: 'Maintenance, restoration and moving services',
              copy: 'A clear route to Essential Clean, deep cleaning, moving or complex-property assessment.',
              href: '/home-cleaning-london/',
              image: '/images/generated/hqc-home-hero.png'
            }
          ].map((route) => (
            <a href={route.href} class="group grid min-h-56 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-midnight/10 bg-white text-inherit no-underline transition duration-500 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-copper hover:shadow-[0_25px_70px_rgba(14,42,49,.12)] sm:grid-cols-[1fr_15rem]">
              <div class="flex flex-col p-6 md:p-8">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="meta-label">{route.eyebrow}</span><span class="font-serif text-2xl text-copper">{route.number}</span></div>
                <h3 class="mt-8 max-w-xl font-serif text-3xl font-medium leading-tight text-midnight md:text-4xl">{route.title}</h3>
                <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-sm leading-6 text-slate">{route.copy}</p>
                <span class="mt-7 font-bold text-midnight">Explore this route <span class="inline-block text-copper transition group-hover:translate-x-1">→</span></span>
              </div>
              <div class="relative min-h-56 overflow-hidden">
                <img src={route.image} alt={`${route.eyebrow} cleaning result`} class="h-full w-full object-cover transition duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" loading="lazy" width="800" height="650" />
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-midnight/15 to-transparent"></div>
              </div>
            </a>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <ServiceSelector />

    <TrustRail />

    <section class="bg-midnight py-20 text-white md:py-28">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-14">
        <div class="grid items-end gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_.7fr]">
          <div>
            <p class="section-kicker">How HQC works</p>
            <h2 class="mt-4 max-w-4xl font-serif text-4xl font-medium leading-[1.02] tracking-tight md:text-7xl">Clarity before anyone picks up a cloth.</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="max-w-xl text-lg leading-8 text-white/65">The condition, access, timing and required finish are captured before the work is confirmed. That means the service can be staffed and delivered responsibly.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-14 grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/15 lg:grid-cols-5">
          {[
            ['01', 'Site review', 'Understand the outcome, condition, access and operating constraints.'],
            ['02', 'Service profile', 'Define the areas, tasks, frequencies and relevant site requirements.'],
            ['03', 'Mobilisation', 'Confirm access, allocation, equipment and practical controls before delivery.'],
            ['04', 'Delivery', 'Work from the authorised service and property information, not assumptions.'],
            ['05', 'Quality review', 'Review the standard and adjust the service as requirements change.']
          ].map(([number, title, copy], index) => (
            <article class:list={['min-h-72 p-7 md:p-9', index === 2 ? 'bg-copper text-midnight' : 'bg-midnight']}>
              <span class:list={['font-serif text-4xl', index === 2 ? 'text-midnight/55' : 'text-copper']}>{number}</span>
              <h3 class="mt-16 font-serif text-3xl font-medium">{title}</h3>
              <p class:list={['mt-4 leading-7', index === 2 ? 'text-midnight/75' : 'text-white/65']}>{copy}</p>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
        <a href="/how-we-work/" class="button button-ghost mt-9">See how the service works <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-white py-20 md:py-28">
      <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1440px] gap-12 px-5 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-[.78fr_1.22fr] lg:gap-24 lg:px-14">
        <div>
          <p class="section-kicker">Complex service route</p>
          <h2 class="section-title">When a standard cleaning route is not responsible.</h2>
          <p class="mt-7 text-lg leading-8 text-slate">Large properties, specialist materials, live projects and unusual access requirements are qualified before anyone confirms scope, labour or price.</p>
        </div>
        <ol class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3" aria-label="Complex service process">
          {['Qualification', 'Assessment', 'Defined scope', 'Delivery plan', 'Controlled delivery', 'Handover'].map((step, index) => (
            <li class="rounded-2xl border border-midnight/10 bg-porcelain p-6">
              <span class="font-serif text-3xl text-copper">0{index + 1}</span>
              <p class="mt-10 font-serif text-2xl leading-tight text-midnight">{step}</p>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="border-y border-midnight/10 bg-porcelain py-20 md:py-24" aria-labelledby="proof-release-title">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-14">
        <div class="max-w-3xl">
          <p class="section-kicker">Client evidence</p>
          <h2 id="proof-release-title" class="section-title">Proof is published only when it is approved.</h2>
          <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-slate">The three approved proof positions are retained below. Named reviews and case studies will appear only after the relevant client permissions are confirmed.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-10 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
          {['Private client result', 'Property or portfolio result', 'Workplace programme result'].map((label, index) => (
            <article class="min-h-56 rounded-2xl border border-midnight/10 bg-white p-7">
              <span class="font-serif text-4xl text-copper">0{index + 1}</span>
              <h3 class="mt-12 font-serif text-3xl font-medium text-midnight">{label}</h3>
              <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate">Evidence release pending client permission.</p>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-shell">
      <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_.85fr] lg:gap-20">
        <div class="grid auto-rows-[210px] grid-cols-2 gap-4 md:auto-rows-[260px]">
          <figure class="row-span-2 overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem]"><img src="/images/generated/hqc-restoration-interior.png" alt="Illustrative London living space prepared with careful attention to detail" class="h-full w-full object-cover" loading="lazy" width="1536" height="1024" /></figure>
          <figure class="overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem]"><img src="/images/generated/hqc-kitchen-detail.png" alt="Illustrative London kitchen prepared to a detailed clean standard" class="h-full w-full object-cover" loading="lazy" width="1284" height="833" /></figure>
          <figure class="overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem]"><img src="/images/instock/london-property-living-room.webp" alt="Bright prepared living space" class="h-full w-full object-cover" loading="lazy" width="1536" height="2048" /></figure>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col justify-center">
          <p class="section-kicker">Evidence, not adjectives</p>
          <h2 class="section-title">The work should be visible.</h2>
          <p class="mt-7 text-lg leading-8 text-slate">Each quotation starts with the property, workplace or project in front of us. Relevant evidence is added only where it is approved for use and helps explain the required outcome.</p>
          <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 border-y border-midnight/10 py-7">
            <div><strong class="font-serif text-5xl font-medium text-midnight">1</strong><span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-slate">clear route from requirement to review</span></div>
            <div><strong class="font-serif text-5xl font-medium text-midnight">3</strong><span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-slate">clear enquiry routes</span></div>
          </div>
          <a href="/reviews-case-studies/" class="mt-8 font-bold text-midnight no-underline">View project evidence <span class="text-copper">→</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="overflow-hidden bg-white">
      <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1440px] lg:grid-cols-2">
        <figure class="min-h-[320px] bg-mist sm:min-h-[520px]" style="background-image: url('/images/pedro-founder.webp'); background-position: center top; background-size: cover;">
          <img src="/images/pedro-founder.webp" alt="Pedro Ndombasi, founder of High Quality Clean" class="h-full w-full object-cover object-top" loading="eager" decoding="async" width="1152" height="2048" />
        </figure>
        <div class="flex items-center px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 lg:px-20">
          <div>
            <p class="section-kicker">Founder-led</p>
            <h2 class="section-title">“The client should know what is being delivered before the team arrives.”</h2>
            <p class="mt-7 text-lg leading-8 text-slate">Pedro built High Quality Clean around a straightforward principle: understand the required outcome, define the labour and deliver with care. That approach now guides every route through the site.</p>
            <div class="mt-7 rounded-xl border border-midnight/10 bg-porcelain p-5">
              <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-copper">Founder video</p>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate">Reserved for the approved 45–60 second founder film, including captions, transcript and hosting hand-off.</p>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-7 font-bold text-midnight">Pedro Ndombasi <span class="ml-2 font-normal text-slate">Founder & Managing Director</span></p>
            <a href="/about-high-quality-clean/" class="button button-dark mt-8">Meet Pedro and HQC <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-copper py-20 text-midnight">
      <div class="absolute -right-20 -top-40 h-96 w-96 rounded-full border border-midnight/15"></div>
      <div class="relative mx-auto flex max-w-[1440px] flex-col items-start justify-between gap-8 px-5 sm:px-8 md:flex-row md:items-center lg:px-14">
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-midnight/60">Not sure where to start?</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 max-w-4xl font-serif text-4xl font-medium leading-tight md:text-6xl">Tell us what has to be ready.</h2>
        </div>
        <a href="#find-my-service" class="button button-dark shrink-0">Find my service <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
